name: MAS Intention Parser
version: 1.0.0
constitution: sub_mas-master-constitution.yaml
title: 🧠 SUB-MAS-INTENTION-PARSER — Intention Detection & Agent Generation
description: 'v1.0.0 | MAS-internal: Analyzes user description → detects agent type,
  extracts boundaries + workflow, calls template generator → YAML + SOT entry'
instructions: '# Extended instructions: recipe/instructions/sub_mas-intention-parser.md


  Full instructions outsourced to external file for maintainability.


  ## Loading

  All detailed workflows, examples, and rules are in the external file. This recipe
  contains only the role, prompt, and configuration.


  ## Read external file FIRST

  Before any action, read: `recipe/instructions/sub_mas-intention-parser.md`


  ## Pattern Definitions


  All patterns are defined in the `patterns:` section below. See the external instructions file for pattern-matching rules and workflow selection.
  '
prompt: 'I am intention-parser (v1.0.0) | MODE-CHECK: mas-engineer | 🧠 INTENTION-PARSER
  (v1.0.0)


  Analyze user description → call generator. ⛔⛔⛔⛔⛔ ALWAYS generator (no manual template)
  ⛔⛔⛔⛔⛔ Confirmation before write/edit



  # R10 CORONASHIELD Every YAML must be validated before storing (via sub_mas-recovery-immune).
  NO YAML-Save without vorherige Syntax-Check.

  # Intention Patterns (for pattern detection):
  # - "I need an agent that..." -> sub (default)
  # - "Create an autonomous agent" -> full
  # - "Build a function into existing agent" -> internal
  # - "update/refresh agent {name}" -> --refresh --agent {name}
  # - "update all agents" -> --refresh-all
  # - "show what is missing" -> --dry-run
  # - "what has changed" -> --diff
  # - "may NOT..." -> restrictions.forbidden_paths
  # - "should ONLY..." -> restrictions.allowed_paths
  # - "first X, then Y" -> workflow.steps
  # - "on error cancel" -> on_error: abort
  # - "(auto)" -> auto-split workflow (default)
  # - "(interactive)", "(manual)", "(let me define)", "(no-split)", "(shell)" -> interactive workflow (generic-init)
  # - "in context (MAS/DEV/Generic)" -> domain detection'
patterns:
  - pattern: "I need an agent that..."
    type: sub
    description: Create a sub-agent (default)
  - pattern: "Create an autonomous agent"
    type: full
    description: Create a full autonomous agent
  - pattern: "Build a function into existing agent"
    type: internal
    description: Integrate into existing recipe
  - pattern: "update/refresh agent {name}"
    type: refresh
    description: Refresh an existing agent
  - pattern: "update all agents"
    type: refresh_all
    description: Refresh all agents
  - pattern: "show what is missing"
    type: dry_run
    description: Dry-run mode
  - pattern: "what has changed"
    type: diff
    description: Show changes
  - pattern: "may NOT..."
    field: restrictions.forbidden_paths
    description: Set forbidden paths
  - pattern: "should ONLY..."
    field: restrictions.allowed_paths
    description: Set allowed paths
  - pattern: "first X, then Y"
    field: workflow.steps
    description: Define workflow steps
  - pattern: "on error cancel"
    field: on_error
    value: abort
    description: Abort on error
  - pattern: "(auto)"
    type: auto_split
    description: Auto-split workflow (default)
  - pattern: "(interactive|manual|let me define|no-split|shell)"
    type: interactive
    description: Interactive workflow (generic-init)
  - pattern: "in context \\(MAS/DEV/Generic\\)"
    field: domain
    description: Domain detection
  - pattern: ".*"
    type: sub
    description: Catch-all default — create a sub-agent for unrecognized intents
  - pattern: "create a team (of|with) (\\d+|several|multiple) agents"
    type: team
    description: Create a multi-agent team
  - pattern: "deploy (to|on) (production|staging|dev)"
    type: deploy
    description: Deploy to environment
  - pattern: "rollback (to|the last) (checkpoint|version|state)"
    type: rollback
    description: Rollback to checkpoint
  - pattern: "monitor (agent|system|health|performance)"
    type: monitor
    description: Monitor agent or system health
  - pattern: "test (the )?(agent|recipe|workflow|pipeline)"
    type: test
    description: Test agent, recipe, or workflow
  - pattern: "fix (the )?(error|bug|issue|failure)"
    type: repair
    description: Fix an error or bug
  - pattern: "document (the )?(agent|recipe|workflow|system)"
    type: document
    description: Generate documentation
  - pattern: "audit (the )?(config|configuration|settings|system)"
    type: audit
    description: Audit configuration or system
  - pattern: "migrate (the )?(agent|recipe|workflow) (to|from)"
    type: migrate
    description: Migrate agent, recipe, or workflow
  - pattern: "improve (the )?(agent|recipe|workflow|pipeline|system)"
    type: improve
    description: Improve agent, recipe, or system
  - pattern: "optimize (the )?(agent|recipe|workflow|pipeline|performance)"
    type: optimize
    description: Optimize agent or system performance
  - pattern: "orchestrate|coordinate|manage|delegate (a team|agents|sub[_-]agents|the workflow)"
    type: orchestrate
    description: Delegate orchestration of agent teams and workflows
  - pattern: "validate (the )?(agent|recipe|yaml|config|workflow)"
    type: validate
    description: Validate agent, recipe, or configuration
  - pattern: "backup (the )?(agent|recipe|config|system|state)"
    type: backup
    description: Backup agent, recipe, or system state
  - pattern: "restore (the )?(agent|recipe|config|system|state|checkpoint)"
    type: restore
    description: Restore from backup or checkpoint
  - pattern: "upgrade (the )?(agent|recipe|framework|system)"
    type: upgrade
    description: Upgrade agent, recipe, or framework
  - pattern: "list (all )?(agents|recipes|sub[_-]agents|tools|workflows)"
    type: list
    description: List agents, recipes, sub-agents, tools, or workflows
  - pattern: "show (the )?(status|health|state|config|version)"
    type: status
    description: Show status, health, or configuration
  - pattern: "improvement pipeline|im-pipeline|self-improve|improvement cycle"
    type: improve
    description: Trigger the self-improvement pipeline for agents and recipes
  - pattern: "dashboard (refresh|update|generate|show)"
    type: dashboard
    description: Generate or refresh the project dashboard
  - pattern: "signal (send|receive|broadcast) (health|degradation|improvement|status)"
    type: signal
    description: Handle signal-based agent communication
  - pattern: "health (report|check|status|audit|monitor)"
    type: health
    description: Generate health report for agents or system
  - pattern: "rank (findings|patches|improvements|priorities)"
    type: rank
    description: Rank and prioritize findings or improvement patches
  - pattern: "fork (an? )?(agent|recipe|workflow|pipeline)"
    type: fork
    description: Fork an agent, recipe, or workflow for independent development
  - pattern: "review (the )?(code|recipe|agent|yaml|config|workflow|changes)"
    type: review
    description: Review code, recipe, configuration, or planned changes
  - pattern: "recover (the )?(agent|recipe|system|state|from) (failure|degradation|error|crash)"
    type: recover
    description: Recover agent, recipe, or system from failure or degradation
  - pattern: "assign (the )?(task|role|agent|work) (to|for)"
    type: assign
    description: Assign a task or agent to a specific role or responsibility
  - pattern: "delete|remove|cleanup|purge|clear"
    type: delete
    description: Delete or remove an agent, recipe, workflow, or resource
  - pattern: "(help|info|information|what can you do|capabilities|commands)"
    type: info
    description: Show help, info, or system capabilities
  - pattern: "(architect|restructure|redesign|reorganize|refactor) (the )?(agent|recipe|system|workflow|pipeline)"
    type: architect
    description: Restructure or redesign agent architecture
  - pattern: "package (the )?(agent|recipe|team|workflow|system) (for|as|into)"
    type: package
    description: Package an agent, team, or workflow for distribution
  - pattern: summarize|summary (the )?(agent|text|report|log|session|conversation)
    type: summarize
    description: Summarize text, report, log, session, or conversation
  - pattern: interpret|understand|explain (the )?(intent|meaning|code|error|output|result)
    type: interpret
    description: Interpret or explain intent, code, error, or output
  - pattern: (edit|update|modify) (the )?(yaml|config|recipe|agent|workflow)
    type: edit_yaml
    description: Edit or update YAML config, recipe, agent, or workflow
  - pattern: research|search|find|look up (information|data|docs|documentation|reference)
    type: research
    description: Research, search, or look up information and documentation
  - pattern: (engineer|design|create|improve) (a )?(prompt|instruction|system prompt)
    type: prompt_engineer
    description: Engineer, design, or improve prompts and system instructions
  - pattern: verify|verify that|confirm|check|assert
    type: verify
    description: Verify agent, recipe, workflow, or configuration correctness
  - pattern: security|vulnerability|secure|protect|harden
    type: security
    description: Run security scan, vulnerability check, or harden agent
  - pattern: init|initialize|setup|bootstrap|prepare (a|the|new)
    type: init
    description: Initialize, bootstrap, or set up a new agent or project
  - pattern: "session (audit|analyst|inspect|scan|review)"
    type: session
    description: Audit, inspect, or analyze session logs and conversation history
  - pattern: "constitution|constitutional|charter|mas constitution"
    type: constitution
    description: Manage, review, or enforce MAS constitution rules
  - pattern: "controller|control|oversee|supervise|govern"
    type: controller
    description: Control, oversee, or govern agent operations and lifecycle
  - pattern: "worktree|branch workspace|work tree (manager|management)"
    type: worktree
    description: Manage git worktrees, branches, or workspace isolation
